{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, then take or check it. Otherwise, if object visible, approach it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = InspectObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLight    />\"",
    "BT": {
        "Blackboard": [
